// PTX ISA version ladder. Each `isa PTX_x_y` is a selectable feature
// (a spec-defined PTX ISA version); instructions are scoped to the version
// that introduced them, so a target can enable support up to any generation
// from 1.0 to the latest. Versions form a cumulative chain via `requires`,
// rooted at the base `PTX` isa (register classes + operand templates).

/// PTX 1.0 feature level for instruction availability. This is the first version in TIR's
/// cumulative PTX version chain and does not imply complete version support.
///
/// See [PTX ISA, version directive](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/parallel-thread-execution/#ptx-module-directives-version).
isa PTX_1_0 requires PTX {}
/// PTX 1.1 feature level for instruction availability. This cumulative TIR feature includes
/// preceding PTX levels and does not imply complete version support.
///
/// See [PTX ISA, version directive](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/parallel-thread-execution/#ptx-module-directives-version).
isa PTX_1_1 requires PTX_1_0 {}
/// PTX 1.2 feature level for instruction availability. This cumulative TIR feature includes
/// preceding PTX levels and does not imply complete version support.
///
/// See [PTX ISA, version directive](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/parallel-thread-execution/#ptx-module-directives-version).
isa PTX_1_2 requires PTX_1_1 {}
/// PTX 1.3 feature level for instruction availability. This cumulative TIR feature includes
/// preceding PTX levels and does not imply complete version support.
///
/// See [PTX ISA, version directive](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/parallel-thread-execution/#ptx-module-directives-version).
isa PTX_1_3 requires PTX_1_2 {}
/// PTX 1.4 feature level for instruction availability. This cumulative TIR feature includes
/// preceding PTX levels and does not imply complete version support.
///
/// See [PTX ISA, version directive](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/parallel-thread-execution/#ptx-module-directives-version).
isa PTX_1_4 requires PTX_1_3 {}
/// PTX 1.5 feature level for instruction availability. This cumulative TIR feature includes
/// preceding PTX levels and does not imply complete version support.
///
/// See [PTX ISA, version directive](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/parallel-thread-execution/#ptx-module-directives-version).
isa PTX_1_5 requires PTX_1_4 {}
/// PTX 2.0 feature level for instruction availability. This cumulative TIR feature includes
/// preceding PTX levels and does not imply complete version support.
///
/// See [PTX ISA 2.0 release notes](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/parallel-thread-execution/#changes-in-ptx-isa-version-2-0).
isa PTX_2_0 requires PTX_1_5 {}
/// PTX 2.1 feature level for instruction availability. This cumulative TIR feature includes
/// preceding PTX levels and does not imply complete version support.
///
/// See [PTX ISA 2.1 release notes](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/parallel-thread-execution/#changes-in-ptx-isa-version-2-1).
isa PTX_2_1 requires PTX_2_0 {}
